# Angles

Paid reframe app. The library is private. Home is a card stack (`GET /stack`, `BUILD.md` 27): other people's public cards one at a time, then From Angles house cards, then an end card. Swipe right or the heart loves the whole card into Profile → Loved (Love is the on-screen name for a save); swipe left or Pass moves on; Rewind undoes any number of steps in a visit. A pass returns once, 12 hours later, on an angle not yet seen. The viewer's own cards never enter the stack; a post closes compose back to the same card with a Posted toast. Compose Save defaults to Post; the server stores a card private unless the save says otherwise. With `FEED_RANKING=resonance` the stack is recency-first with saves, follows, themes, and pacing (rulebook `docs/home-feed.md`, weights `BUILD.md` 14); unset stays newest-first. A header holds the filter (life areas, moods), notifications, and Settings. Profile (Yours | Loved) and author pages stay unranked lists of the old feed card.

- Backend: Hono + Node on Railway (`backend/`). Not Cloudflare Workers.
- iOS: SwiftUI, iOS 17+, `URLSession` only (`AnglesApp/`). Run on **Joe’s iPhone**, not Simulator.
- LLM: `backend/src/lib/llmClient.ts` only. Never from the app.
- Screen/feature order is `BUILD.md`. Build only the current item. Update that file in the same change as every new screen or feature.
- Do not add SwiftData until that row in `BUILD.md` is next (or the user asked for that task). StoreKit, Drizzle, and Auth have shipped.
- `POST /cards` only stores a cook signed by `/reframe` (`backend/src/lib/cookSignature.ts`); never loosen that to trust client content.
- `POST /reframe` never stores cards or plaintext thought text; it may write only text-free metering/idempotency metadata, provider token/cost records, and the hour-long replay sealed under the client's `Replay-Key` (`reframeReplay.ts`), which the server never stores.
- Safety fails closed: an unknown safety label is `self_harm`. The model never writes crisis numbers; `crisisResources.ts` picks them by the request `region`.
- Access past a failed renewal is Apple's grace period only. `billing_retry` is stored but locked.
- Keep `backend/src/types/index.ts` and `ReframeModels.swift` JSON-identical.
- Do not log user thought text. Do not add browser CORS.
- Auth is Better Auth (Sign in with Apple). Owner seam is `requireAuth` / `getOwnerUserId()` in `authStub.ts`. DB is Postgres + Drizzle (`postgres` driver).
- Showcase TikToks: read the **Cut contract** at the top of `demo/README.md`. Four style chapters then outro. Never a fifth “best” chapter, Post, or Home beat.
- Prefer failing a multi-style reframe over a partial `results` array.
